"Clytem Zhao, called Cly or Ms. Zhao, is Hannah Elber's best friend from school and gym class."
"She is an S-rank Sway, a long-range mind sniper who destroys a single target's mind."
"Her power serves only assassination, so she keeps a spotless record and stays a good girl."
"She says she has been pure of heart since fifteen, lest some paranoid hero wipe her out."
"Her parents are superhumans."
"She has brown eyes and wears her black hair in a sleek bun."
"She went to the same hero school on Anesidora as Hannah and Keiko Velra."
"She took her first off-island job, a posting in Toronto, and threw a going-away brunch."
"Her favorite restaurant is a Sichuan place on Anesidora."
"She offered to take Hannah as her sidekick at a 60/40 salary split."
"She left Alden Thorn voicemails about Hannah's disappearance and funeral."
"She arranged Alden's teleport to Anesidora for the funeral and put ten Argold under his name."
"She picked Alden up in F City and took him to the funeral, which she helped organize."
"She drinks smoothies."
"At Hannah's funeral she wept front and center."
